<Slide style={{ background: '#0C0E14', paddingTop: 40, paddingBottom: 20, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 76, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 36, height: 3, background: '#34D399' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#34D399', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>EQUIPMENT MEMORY</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>设备记忆体：经验不再随人流失</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 470, background: '#161A24', borderRadius: 14, border: '1px solid #232838', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6', marginBottom: 6 }}>五类高频记忆自动沉淀</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666D80', marginBottom: 18 }}>写库即构建：图谱 + 向量 + 事件，无需额外维护知识库</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #232838' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 10, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,.14)', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>01</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>运行工况</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD' }}>负载、环境、启停与工艺参数的历史轨迹</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #232838' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 10, background: 'rgba(52,211,153,.14)', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#34D399', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>02</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>故障与处置</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD' }}>现象、判据、根因、处置动作与效果回溯</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #232838' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 10, background: 'rgba(96,165,250,.14)', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#60A5FA', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>03</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>部件与备件</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD' }}>BOM 结构、寿命分布、齐套与替代关系</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #232838' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 10, background: 'rgba(251,191,36,.14)', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FBBF24', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>04</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>工艺耦合</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD' }}>设备—产线拓扑，谁是上游、谁被牵连</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #232838' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 10, background: 'rgba(167,139,250,.14)', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#A78BFA', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>05</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>检修记录</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD' }}>点检、保养、改造、校验的完整留痕</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#666D80', marginTop: 16 }}>租户级隔离：你的故障库不会变成别人的训练集</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 14, border: '1px solid #2C3346', padding: 22, flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666D80', marginBottom: 12 }}>语义检索示例</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          "上次这台泵同样的振动频谱，是怎么处理的？"
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#232838', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 16 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A4ABBD', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
          系统调出该设备历史同类事件的处置记录、判据与效果评价，比对本次频谱后给出"沿用 / 修正 / 升级"的建议与理由——不是重新从零判断。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ background: '#13161E', borderRadius: 14, border: '1px solid #2C3346', padding: 22, flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666D80', marginBottom: 12 }}>复盘回写</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#34D399', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          处置结束，才是知识产生的开始
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#232838', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 16 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A4ABBD', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
          复盘智能体定期扫描当期决策与工单，自动归因并产出可审查的报告；误判修正判据阈值，成功处置固化为标准处置卡，审批后回灌记忆与知识库。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #232838' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666D80' }}>ChiYu AI · AI 原生设备管理平台</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666D80' }}>08 / 14</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
